@page "/"
@inject Microsoft.Extensions.Options.IOptions<Ben.Data.Common.SiteIdentity> SiteOptions

<PageTitle>@SiteOptions.Value.Name — @SiteOptions.Value.Tagline</PageTitle>

@*
    The landing page is three library components, same as the original host: the hero with its
    location search, then what is near the visitor, then the public case map. All three are
    anonymous-safe — they degrade to a browse or a prompt rather than requiring a sign-in.
*@

<HomeHero />
<NearbyDiscovery />
@* Item 186 F9: the feed's front door on the front page. Renders nothing while the feed is dark. *@
<Ben.Web.Website.Library.Feed.FeedTeaser />
@* Item 166 W3: one promoted group per load, rotating server-side, always marked. *@
<div class="container-fluid px-3" style="max-width:860px;margin:auto;">
    <PromotedGroupsCard />
</div>
<PublicCaseDiscovery />
